<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus, eternal High Priest,<br />
you who celebrated the first Mass at the Last Supper<br />
and sealed it with your blood on the cross,<br />
open my eyes to see what really happens in every liturgy.<br />
Let me go to Mass not out of habit, but out of love.<br />
Make me not a spectator, but a living member of your Body.<br />
When I sing the Holy, make me truly join<br />
the song of angels and saints in heaven.<br />
And when I leave the church,<br />
let me carry your presence to every person I meet.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

